		{
			dependencies: ["568C8D9230CD9FBB"]
			description: ["Four ways lead out of the hull: the strand, the circuits and components, the home machines, and the probe to Sagittarius A*. This one follows the probe. The Machines, Circuits and Integration sections have the rest."]
