		{
			dependencies: ["115B5942935339A3", "73F533AC440AACF3"]
			description: ["A relay probe for the Galactic Centre. It is an assembly-line recipe researched at the Hawking drive, and it takes metal feedstock, so make that first. Its sinter casing comes from the Cluster-Light Furnace line. The ring at Cygnus X-1 throws it, with the Sagittarius A* chart kept in its store."]
