		{
			dependencies: ["1E1DCCA995ABBA6C"]
			description: ["Motors, a piston and a circuit: the &6MAX Robot Arm&r. It is also what the belt seed and the Rydberg works are built around."]
			icon: "grindless:max_robot_arm"
