		}
		{
			dependencies: ["764F18E0B5749AFE"]
			description: ["The &6Ergoregion Synchroniser&r locks a clock to the spin of the hole. &oFiction:&r the hole is held still long enough to be measured. The second mode relocks a spent lock so it can be used again. The oscillator bank, a closed shell and the casings and parts new to this machine. The horizon phase lock of the last recipe. Send each spent lock back in by bus; it never leaves the line."]
			icon: "gtceu:ergoregion_synchroniser"
			id: "5D21090FD9E824F1"
