		{
			dependencies: ["764F18E0B5749AFE"]
			description: ["The &6Horizon Flux Clamp&r winds the field of the shell into a winding and, in its second mode, catches a plasmoid thrown by a reconnecting field line. A closed shell and the casings and parts new to this machine. The winding that the last recipe needs, and a plasmoid for the lines that use one. Windings leave by bus. A plasmoid is a hot output, so contain it and route it."]
			icon: "gtceu:horizon_flux_clamp"
