		{
			dependencies: ["5246FF455E6244E1"]
			description: ["The &6Horizon Strand Repeater&r is the link part of the MAX wireless hatches: the energy hatch and the dynamo hatch each take repeaters in their recipe. Horizon strand wire, a chain strand repeater and a MAX sensor, with solder and lubricant, in an assembler at MAX voltage. The MAX wireless energy and dynamo hatches. Nothing to feed: make a stock of repeaters for the hatches."]
			icon: "grindless:horizon_strand_repeater"
			id: "1B14456734D691CA"
			rewards: [{ id: "1F65A4F29D932823", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
