		}
		{
			dependencies: ["33DDC08F5E410B5F"]
			description: ["The &6Droplet Radiator Works&r and &6Femtosecond Writer&r each take MAX rows: the radiator works builds the shell droplet radiator, and the writer makes the droplet nozzle plate, the squeezer and isolator waveguide dies, the trimmed microring, the end-capped fibre and the welded glass cell. The UIV controllers you already own. The shell radiator and the parts the squeezed-light line uses. Plates by bus; send each output to its own line."]
