			x: 25.0d
			y: -0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["187F0BA64323CC4D", "373D406AA533F310"]
			description: ["A library of every genome the pack has met, written to crystal in a sealed cold vault. The &6Gene Ark&r makes the genome archive that goes into the last seed. The MAX hull, a sterilising filter casing vault with a cryogenic core, a Rydberg logic array and a superconducting membrane. The genome archive, which the later gates and MAX+ count on. Genomes arrive by ME; one archive is enough, so cap it."]
			icon: "gtceu:gene_ark"
			id: "77428218C6DD16A7"
			rewards: [{ id: "3C665EF9B591A0A2", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "5BC142BB55DB415D", item: "gtceu:gene_ark", type: "item" }]
			title: "Gene Ark"
			x: 27.5d
			y: -3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["77428218C6DD16A7"]
			description: [
				"The &6Genome Archive&r is every genome the pack has met, written to crystal: what is written there is what the new universe remembers."
				"The Gene Ark makes it from the genomes you have collected on the way, in its sealed cold vault. The last seed needs it, and so do the gates and MAX+ after it. One archive is enough: bring the genomes in by ME and cap the output."
			]
			icon: "grindless:genome_archive"
			id: "5A94EB5921E6E09A"
			rewards: [{ id: "55812DFFDC074197", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1D453EDF84B7E8AB", item: "grindless:genome_archive", type: "item" }]
			title: "Genome Archive"
			x: 30.0d
			y: -3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["33DDC08F5E410B5F"]
			description: ["It looks at the light that has gone round the hole, and from the ring it reads the spin and charts the cluster. The &6Photon Ring Imager&r is the eye of the whole era. The MAX hull, a ring of dish panels on a truss and a cold core of receivers, built in orbit around Sagittarius A*, with a Rydberg logic array. The spin map and the cluster ephemeris, both on the journey. It works one image at a time, so give it its own array supply and leave it."]
			icon: "gtceu:photon_ring_imager"
			id: "38957F897FD4B1D2"
			rewards: [{ id: "16F3D4B7760A17A4", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "gear"
