				{ id: "3B0A0FFA59ED99D3", item: "grindless:max_srf_cavity", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Photon Ring Imager"
			x: 25.0d
			y: -8.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["33DDC08F5E410B5F"]
			description: ["A tether dropped over the horizon and wound on a drum. The &6Geroch Winch&r takes power from the hole's spin; each run uses up a canister and wears the tether. The MAX hull, a tall tower of drum casing over a tether well, and a canister and a tether for each run. The first power the galactic centre gives back. Canisters and tethers run out, so keep a pattern provider on them."]
			icon: "gtceu:geroch_winch"
			id: "110860BEED613414"
			rewards: [{ id: "54C2F1DBAE7BC73C", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "749A97CBDBB43D9D", item: "gtceu:geroch_winch", type: "item" }
				{ id: "5219A537BCC87714", item: "grindless:geroch_drum_casing", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Geroch Winch"
			x: 27.5d
			y: -9.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["33DDC08F5E410B5F"]
			description: ["It shapes hot flow into streams, and the streams into bundles. The &6Mass Stream Injector&r holds a shell up with moving mass. The MAX hull, a ring of stream-turn casing round a pellet accelerator, and a matter-wave gradiometer from the atom works at home. The stream bundle, which the mirror shell is built round. Pellets by ME; bundles come out in a chest and go straight to the shell."]
			icon: "gtceu:mass_stream_injector"
			id: "53636F954A3A7FC5"
			rewards: [{ id: "3ED9716592A6BDB8", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "59859201F927DD25", item: "gtceu:mass_stream_injector", type: "item" }
